      {
       "text": "Greetings fellow Postmen!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have launched a patch to improve Paperman: Adventure Delivered. We hope you will have a more smooth experience with these improvements and fixes implemented.",
